WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.232 --> 00:00:01.864
♪ soft piano music ♪

00:00:03.653 --> 00:00:06.317
[Narrator] There is something very special about owning a home

00:00:07.118 --> 00:00:09.513
It’s more than just four walls and a roof

00:00:10.195 --> 00:00:11.532
But if those walls could talk

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:13.300
they’d tell you about all the adventures

00:00:13.301 --> 00:00:14.403
you’ll start in them

00:00:14.411 --> 00:00:14.973
(dog barks)

00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:16.879
and the memories you’re going to make

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.879
More than just a place to live

00:00:18.881 --> 00:00:21.541
a home is the place where life unfolds

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:23.670
It’s a place of many firsts

00:00:23.939 --> 00:00:25.861
Like first meal in the new place

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:29.911
First steps

00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:30.913
(child giggles)

00:00:33.981 --> 00:00:35.585
First wheels (bicycle bell chimes)

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.375
And first independence

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.302
[Daughter] Yes!

00:00:42.652 --> 00:00:44.951
(car door opens, engine starts)

00:00:45.251 --> 00:00:46.043
(car horn honks)

00:00:48.689 --> 00:00:50.780
[Narrator] First to leave the nest (dog whimpers)

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.773
and come back home again

00:00:52.774 --> 00:00:53.816
(dog barks excitedly)

00:00:54.306 --> 00:00:55.966
And if these walls could talk

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:59.606
they would definitely tell you how important it is to help protect your family

00:00:59.606 --> 00:01:02.148
with Manulife’s mortgage protection insurance

00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:04.918
It can help cover the mortgage payments

00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:07.037
if something unexpected happens

00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:09.260
Like an injury or illness (dog whimpers)

00:01:11.319 --> 00:01:13.863
Or if one of you were no longer in the picture

00:01:15.629 --> 00:01:17.721
It’s about more than just insurance

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.129
It’s about helping to make sure your loved ones are protected

00:01:25.698 --> 00:01:29.906
Talk to your mortgage broker or lender about Manulife’s mortgage protection insurance

